From d992ff7b89ff3c5b514116543456c0ec2c66006a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:47:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/78] Port H006+$01AE (Initialize_GameEnvironment) and its
 leaf services

Ports the game environment setup called from main, plus the DOS
adapters Open/Close/Read/Seek/Execute, intuition CurrentTime, the H026
case-insensitive string compare ($003A, $0088, $0106), the H029 byte
fill ($0312), the H031 word swap ($0012) and the H028 file check
($02D0). Pointers held in H005 become C variables. The program now
stops at H029+$1206, the screen and window setup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
